{"title":"Available Slides","markdown":{"yaml":{"pagetitle":"Slides & Materials | DahShu IDSWG","description":"Slide decks, presentations, apps, and downloadable materials from DahShu IDSWG meetings, conferences, and sub-team activities.","image":"images/IDSWG_Banner.png","page-layout":"full"},"headingText":"Available Slides","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"hero-section hero-publications\" id=\"main-content\">\n  <h1>Slides &amp; Materials</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Slide decks, interactive apps, and downloadable materials from IDSWG meetings, sub-team activities, and conference presentations.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n::: {.content-section}\n\nThis page houses downloadable and interactive materials from the IDSWG community, including slide decks, apps, and tools. Items are added when permission has been granted by the author or sub-team lead.\n\n\n```{=html}\n<ul class=\"pub-list\">\n\n  <li>\n    <span class=\"pub-year\">Sep 2025</span><br/>\n    <strong>IDSWG Introduction, ASA-BIOP Regulatory-Industry Statistics Workshop (RISW 2025)</strong><br/>\n    Beckman RA. Overview of IDSWG vision, leadership, sub-teams, and selected past work. Presented September 21, 2025.<br/>\n    <a href=\"files/IDSWG_Introduction_RISW_2025.pptx\" download>\n      <i class=\"bi bi-download\"></i> Download PPTX (1.7 MB)\n    </a>\n  </li>\n\n</ul>\n```\n\n## Apps & Interactive Tools\n\n```{=html}\n<ul class=\"pub-list\">\n  <li>\n    <span class=\"pub-year\">Coming Soon</span><br/>\n    <strong>Master Protocol Repository App</strong><br/>\n    Interactive application for browsing and filtering master protocol trials by design type, disease area, phase, and sponsor. Built and maintained by the MPWG Concept, Methodology and Framework Sub-team.<br/>\n    <em style=\"color:#888;font-size:0.85rem;\">Deployment in progress. Link will be added here when available.</em>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n## Adding Slides or Materials\n\nTo add slides, an app, or other materials, contact Bryan McComb ([bryan.mccomb@pfizer.com](mailto:bryan.mccomb@pfizer.com)) or Courtney Henry ([courtney.n.henry@gsk.com](mailto:courtney.n.henry@gsk.com)) with the file and confirmation of permission to share. See the [README](https://github.com) for technical instructions on uploading files to the `files/` folder.\n\n```{=html}\n<p class=\"last-updated\"><i class=\"bi bi-clock\"></i> Page last reviewed: <span class=\"auto-date\"></span></p>\n```\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"hero-section hero-publications\" id=\"main-content\">\n  <h1>Slides &amp; Materials</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Slide decks, interactive apps, and downloadable materials from IDSWG meetings, sub-team activities, and conference presentations.</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n::: {.content-section}\n\nThis page houses downloadable and interactive materials from the IDSWG community, including slide decks, apps, and tools. Items are added when permission has been granted by the author or sub-team lead.\n\n## Available Slides\n\n```{=html}\n<ul class=\"pub-list\">\n\n  <li>\n    <span class=\"pub-year\">Sep 2025</span><br/>\n    <strong>IDSWG Introduction, ASA-BIOP Regulatory-Industry Statistics Workshop (RISW 2025)</strong><br/>\n    Beckman RA. Overview of IDSWG vision, leadership, sub-teams, and selected past work. Presented September 21, 2025.<br/>\n    <a href=\"files/IDSWG_Introduction_RISW_2025.pptx\" download>\n      <i class=\"bi bi-download\"></i> Download PPTX (1.7 MB)\n    </a>\n  </li>\n\n</ul>\n```\n\n## Apps & Interactive Tools\n\n```{=html}\n<ul class=\"pub-list\">\n  <li>\n    <span class=\"pub-year\">Coming Soon</span><br/>\n    <strong>Master Protocol Repository App</strong><br/>\n    Interactive application for browsing and filtering master protocol trials by design type, disease area, phase, and sponsor. Built and maintained by the MPWG Concept, Methodology and Framework Sub-team.<br/>\n    <em style=\"color:#888;font-size:0.85rem;\">Deployment in progress. Link will be added here when available.</em>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n## Adding Slides or Materials\n\nTo add slides, an app, or other materials, contact Bryan McComb ([bryan.mccomb@pfizer.com](mailto:bryan.mccomb@pfizer.com)) or Courtney Henry ([courtney.n.henry@gsk.com](mailto:courtney.n.henry@gsk.com)) with the file and confirmation of permission to share. See the [README](https://github.com) for technical instructions on uploading files to the `files/` folder.\n\n```{=html}\n<p class=\"last-updated\"><i class=\"bi bi-clock\"></i> Page last reviewed: <span class=\"auto-date\"></span></p>\n```\n:::\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","css":["styles.css"],"toc":false,"in